00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:37.540
The rule now requires volume above the 20-day average before entering any catalyst-driven

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.520
name already in a sector rotation.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:48.040
Portfolio performance shows 73 total trades at a 52% win rate and cumulative profit of $288.22.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:55.440
cents. The mashed window alpha versus Nasdaq stands at negative 19.22% across 22 rules-based

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:01.680
trades. The record began on August 18, 2026, under the published rules of five session holds,

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:08.880
